WEBVTT

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:31.710
Come on, Hina-nee. We're going to your room.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.540
Um, shouldn't you be a bit more...?

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.000
It's fine. I always do it like this.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:48.080
It's also Hina-nee's fault for letting her guard down,
the way she's like this.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:01.630
Why didn't anyone wake me up?!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.250
Mijuku mujou saredo

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.250
Inexperienced, heartless, but even so,

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:16.410
Utsukushiku are

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:16.410
Be beautiful

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:27.370
No Destiny fusawashiku nai

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:27.370
No Destiny, unworthy

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.330
Konnanja kitto monotarinai

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.330
If it's like this, then probably things will go well

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.420
You okay...?

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.420
Did something happen...?

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.420
I'll...

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:29.420
Be waiting for you...

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.160
Kurai katattokeba umaku iku

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.160
If we just talk as if it's never enough

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:33.410
Mono, kane, ai, koto,

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:33.410
Things, money, love, words,

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.160
Mou jikokenji akita

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.160
I'm tired of self-asserting myself already

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.250
I got here before you.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.250
I have the correct meeting place, right?

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.250
Did something happen? You okay?

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:42.370
Déjà vu nani ga sonna fuman nanda?

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:42.370
Déjà vu, what are you so unsatisfied about?

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.120
Sanzan wagamama katattoite

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.120
You've said all sorts of selfish things,

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.040
Kore ijou hoka ni nani ga iru?

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.040
what more could you possibly want?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:50.830
Sonna tokoro mo warito kirai ja nai

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:50.830
I kind of don't mind that about you

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.460
Mou "kiki akitanda yo sono serifu"

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.460
Honestly, "I'm sick of hearing that line"

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:00.250
Chuuto hanpa dake ha iya

00:01:56.660 --> 00:02:00.250
The one thing I don't want is ambiguousness

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:03.000
Mou ii aa shite kou shite ittetatte

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:03.000
Enough. Even if you say to do this or that,

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.870
Aishite doushite? iwaretatte

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.870
Even if you say love me, or why?

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:06.660
Asobi dakenara kantan de

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:06.660
It's easy if it's just for fun

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.460
Shinken koushou muchakucha de

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.460
And that it's reckless serious negotiating

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.790
Omoi mo shinai omoi kotoba

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.790
How many times are those worn out unexpectedly

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:14.870
Nando tsukai furusu noka?

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:14.870
Serious words going to be used?

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:17.960
Douse kitai shitetanda deki race demo

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:17.960
We were hoping anyway, even if it was a fixed race,

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.580
Inyou darake no phrase mo

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.580
Even all those quoted phrases,

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:24.210
Kakato mochiagaru kotoba taboo ni shite

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:24.210
Making backtracking words taboo

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:28.330
Kuuki wo yonda ame furanaide yo

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:28.330
Take a hint, don't let it rain

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:31.080
Domestic Girlfriend

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:41.170
Yo! It's unusual that you'd do something
like be late, Natsuo.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.330
Anyway, what's with that crazy bed head?

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.250
I didn't have time...

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:49.380
Hey, guess what?!
They say there's a transfer student in Class 2!

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:50.540
Guy or girl?

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:53.250
Girl! Sounds like she's pretty, too!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.170
Wanna go see?

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.630
Hey, you know first period's about to start.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:57.830
Now, now.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:02:59.250
Just a look. We're just gonna look.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.290
That girl is...

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.750
From the mixer...

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.420
That's some crazy bed head.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.170
You came over to say that?

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:28.540
From the looks of it, I bet you didn't bring
your lunch, right? Mom left it on the table-

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.080
What?

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.330
You decided to transfer schools?

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.830
You didn't hear about it?

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.170
I didn't hear about it.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.540
I didn't want a long-distance commute to school.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.250
What do you want to do about us?

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.330
Huh?

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:51.170
Our relationship! About how we explain it to everyone.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.330
Relationship...?

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:57.380
You mean the fact that we had sex once
but then became siblings?

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.000
Well, that of course,
should be kept strictly confidential! But...

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.040
I think there's really no reason to tell everyone.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.290
You know, that we're siblings now.

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:11.460
Even though our parents are remarrying,
our last names aren't changing.

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:14.750
Plus, if people find out that we're living together,
then it's possible that strange rumors might spread...

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.290
Aren't you going to fix your bed head?

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:19.330
Are you even listening?

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:24.540
Why don't you do what you want?
Besides, I'm not going to blab about my home life.

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:28.750
Basically, you're saying,
"Don't talk to me at school," right?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:30.040
I got it.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.710
I didn't say it like that!

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:39.250
Na-tsu-o-kun!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:43.080
There's a little something we want to ask you about...

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:47.380
Looks like you've been enjoying yourself, Mr. Big Shot.
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:51.790
You did say that nothing happened
after you disappeared from the mixer, right?

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:54.080
Honestly, it's insignificant...

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:57.330
Seems that way for her too...

00:04:58.790 --> 00:04:59.710
Huh?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.960
I'm gonna stop by the john.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.380
To poop?

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:10.420
Yeah, yeah. To poop...

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.830
What the hell? Am I the one who said something wrong?

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.880
Please cooperate

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.880
in water conservation.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:30.420
Hold on, there! What's with that hair?!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:31.000
Huh?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.750
S-Sensei! I, uh, didn't have time this morning and...

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:35.830
What?

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.420
I had asked Rui to wake you up, but...

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.830
All she does is call out once so...

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:43.960
Wake up.

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.880
Why, that...!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.380
I've been fixing it since everyone's
been taking digs at it, but...

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.330
It's fine the way it is.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.500
That fluffy hair is cute.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.420
Um, by the way...

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.130
Hmm?

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:06.040
In regards to school, have you told anyone
that we're siblings now?

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:07.330
Nope, not yet.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:11.170
I personally think there's really no reason
to make it public, you know...

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:16.750
Ah! I can see how you might have issues with that,
Natsuo-kun. Got it. Understood.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.920
Have I offended you?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.830
Not at all. Why?

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.290
That's fine, then.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:27.630
By the way, Sensei... do you remember last night?

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.790
What?! What're you saying?! By any chance...!

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:30.830
Huh?! What?!

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.000
By any chance...

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.460
did we kiss?

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.170
No, no, no, no!

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:36.960
We didn't?

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.170
We did not!

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.830
What a relief!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:45.080
Apparently, I got drunk once and did that
to a female friend, so I thought I'd done it again.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.830
Ah, so that's what you meant...

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:51.960
When I'm at home, I just inadvertently get too relaxed.
Not good. Not good at all.

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:55.460
I'll be more careful, but if I do cause you
any trouble again, I'm sorry for that.

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:02.920
By all means, please feel free to!

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.790
Natsuo, what's up?

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:16.540
Huh?

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.460
Oh, uh, it's nothing...

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.790
You ate lunch by yourself?

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:37.080
That a problem?

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:39.420
No, it's not a problem, but...

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.710
Weren't we suppose to act like strangers?

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:47.580
What I meant was that instead of being strangers,
we could at least be friends! Speaking of...

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:55.500
There were more people crowded around you
this morning. Didn't you get invited to eat with anyone?

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:58.040
It became fewer and fewer people
as each break went by.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.130
Did you pick a fight or something?

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.790
I'm Chika. Nice to meetcha!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.210
I'm Sanae. Call me "Sana."

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:10.040
Tachibana-san, is it okay if we call you Rui-chan?

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.170
Go ahead. Call me whatever you want.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:15.630
Uh, Rui-chan, I bet you were popular with guys
at your previous school since you're cute, right?

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:17.500
Like, do you have a boyfriend right now, too?

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.420
I'm not popular with guys,
don't have one, and not interested.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:24.540
Do you use any social media?

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.880
Can you tell us your account name?

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:28.040
I don't do any of that,

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.040
and I think using up time for that kind of stuff...

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:31.830
is pointless.

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:36.000
You totally were picking a fight!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.580
That wasn't my intention.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:39.710
Just because you think that, doesn't mean...

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:42.170
Your bed head still isn't fixed?

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.920
Huh? Oh, I've tried getting it wet but it still won't...

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.500
Turn your back to me. I'll fix it.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.880
Huh? O-okay...

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:57.830
It's tangled. There's no point getting it wet then.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:02.250
I get it now. She's...

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.380
Rui Tachibana.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.830
Although whatever you decide is up to you.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.170
From the looks of it,
I bet you didn't bring your lunch, right?

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:13.790
Maybe just a little socially awkward...

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:15.920
All done.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:18.330
Thank you...

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:25.420
You know, shouldn't you be
a little more careful of how you say things?

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:29.580
It might not be intentional,
but you're pretty much saying you don't want friends...

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.960
It's always like this.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.750
Hina-nee always quickly becomes friends with anyone,

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:36.750
but for me...

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.880
it never goes well.

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:41.130
All right.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.580
I'm gonna give you special training.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:46.630
Huh?

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:49.880
You know, first off, you gotta stop with that "Huh?" stuff.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:53.080
I'll act like one of your classmates
and start talking to you, so try responding.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:56.290
Okay? Ahem! Ready?

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.670
Hey, hey, Rui-chan!

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.500
What do you, like, do on your days off?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.000
Transgender?

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.420
I'm pretending to be one of your female friends!

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:09.960
Come on! What do you do on your days off?

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:13.210
I often read books on my days off.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:14.710
What kind of books?

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.880
You probably wouldn't know, even if I tell you.

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:20.630
Don't just end the conversation!
It's important to keep it going!

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:25.170
This is playing conversational catch while smiling!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:27.630
I also like and often read stuff like You Hasukawa!

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:32.420
Ah! You mean that pretentious intellectual normie
who seems like he's struggling with love...

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:34.580
Don't diss a person's taste with a smile!

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:37.880
Are you even trying to talk with the intent
to make the other person like you?!

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.080
I'm just being honest when I talk.

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:43.290
I'm not telling you to lie! I'm saying
that you need to be more considerate!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:46.330
Like talking just a bit more in a way
that makes the other person feel good.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.420
Why're you saying something
like a customer at a hostess club would say?

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:53.000
Who're you calling a customer of a hostess club?!
Besides, I wouldn't pay money for a hostess like you!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.500
A customer's circumstance isn't my problem.
The bill is 100,000 yen.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.170
What?! For talking to you?! That's a total rip-off!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.750
What, you gotta problem with that? Hey, security!

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:01.630
Don't call them over!

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:04.330
Anyway, what're we talking about?! In the first place-

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:07.920
Huh?

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:11.790
Why, Tachibana-san, you're actually pretty agreeable.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:14.040
What was that mini skit just now?

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:17.000
Oh, no, that was just her...

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:19.750
In that case, Rui-chan, let's be friends.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.960
We wanted that to happen anyway.

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.500
I guess, if you want to.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.830
I guess that standoffishness doesn't change.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:31.580
That's true!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.290
At any rate, I'm glad...

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.630
I was a little worried, even for someone as blunt as her.

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:48.710
Speaking of, I wonder how she got by at her old school?

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.500
WHOA! Sorry!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:00.330
It's fine. No big deal. You've already seen me once.

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:02.790
No, no, no! That's not the point!

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.460
About today... Thanks.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:17.170
Uh, sure... Seriously, sorry again. I'll come back later.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.290
Why don't you come in?

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:19.670
What?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.250
Come again?

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.920
It's okay. Just come in for a bit.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.460
Wh-what the hell are you saying?!

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:42.170
You're already undressed.

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:45.130
You...! We may be siblings, but we're...

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:47.130
Uh... Oh!

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.330
Please.

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:53.380
Just one more time, with me...

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.040
There's just a little something I want to ask you.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:12:59.830
Huh?

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:03.330
About last night.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.290
It's kind of hard to talk about in the living room, right?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:18.790
S-so...?

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:23.540
What was the reason behind you trying to kiss Hina-nee?

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:27.000
I'd written you off because I thought
you were just an irresponsible jerk

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.920
who was an indiscriminate womanizer, but...

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:32.460
After seeing the way you were today,
I thought that maybe that's not it.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.130
By any chance, about Hina-nee...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.420
Were you trying to cheer her up?

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:44.750
Huh?!

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:50.670
It wasn't that you heard from Hina-nee
about her boyfriend?

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:51.790
What?

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:56.040
Grown-ups have grown-up things they have to deal with.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:01.000
Is Sensei going through a difficult time or something?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.630
If you haven't heard anything, then never mind.
Forget about what I said.

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:07.040
Wai-!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.790
She keeps saying to forget, forget, but...!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.380
Morning!

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.880
Ah, morning!

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.040
Morning!

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.500
It's miso soup with daikon radish! Lucky!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:35.830
Hmm?

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:41.040
Uh, we have an announcement for everyone.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:45.670
The two of us are going to go to the ward office today
and submit our marriage registration.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:51.670
So, you'll finally be an officially married couple.
Then today will become your wedding anniversary.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.170
Mom, congrats.

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:54.580
Thank you.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:59.830
So, we were thinking of going out to eat afterwards,
just the two of us, but is that okay?

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.580
Of course that's okay!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:03.460
Right?

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.330
Will it be okay with just the three of you?

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:09.920
We will be just fine! A proper adult will be present!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:13.580
You say that, but you're not going
to be all drunk again, right?

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.790
I'll drink in moderation.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:20.130
All right! Maybe I'll do my best for today's dinner then!

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:21.880
That makes me worry...

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:23.130
That's mean!

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:25.540
Rui, you help out too, okay?

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:26.580
Mm-hmm.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.290
Sensei's home cooking, huh...?

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.750
...what could I do for...

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.790
...to treat someone

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:43.790
to a home-cooked meal...

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.170
I wonder if Sensei's good at cooking...

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.710
...to treat someone...

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.710
...impressed by how good...

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:01.170
Here you are! Please eat!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.540
Amazing!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.920
Did you make all this, Sensei?!

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.420
Rui and I did.

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:09.170
Let's eat!

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:17.500
This is seriously good! This is like a restaurant's!
Sensei, you really can do anything!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.630
Rui actually made that, though...

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:24.330
Oh... My bad...

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.000
Uh, then what did YOU make, Sensei?

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.290
Let's see...

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:31.500
This one, and...

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:32.670
this one, and...

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:33.960
this one...

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.290
That's... cooking?

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:41.710
If I left the seasoning to Hina-nee,
she's too arbitrary with it and it'd be way too risky.

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.460
Rui, you're so harsh...

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:46.210
Are you disappointed?

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.880
No, not at all!

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:52.830
The way these edamame were boiled,
and like the thickness of these tomatoes are just right!

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:55.540
Natsuo-kun, you're super nice!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.630
Well, in a way, I guess this is just like Sensei.

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:08.080
I feel bad, leaving you to do the cleanup.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.960
Has this cut down on some of your writing time?

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.880
Nah, you guys did the cooking, so...

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.000
Huh? Speaking of, what about her?

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:21.670
Rui? She's probably in her room reading a book.
She goes straight to her room after meals.

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:24.080
As her big sis, that makes me feel a little lonely.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.630
Sensei, isn't it because you get drunk so quickly?

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:29.040
Hey! Formalities! What do we call each other?

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:33.290
Oh! Excuse... I mean, sorry...

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.000
This is all rather sudden, isn't it?
I guess you can't adjust right away.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:43.080
But, we are family now, so if you're ever in trouble,
then don't hesitate because I'm your sensei.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.630
Feel free to talk to me about anything.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.960
I'm sorry if this is none of my business to ask, but...

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:02.540
Are things not going too well with your boyfriend?

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:10.080
Did you hear something from Rui?

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.250
Uh, no...

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:15.500
I don't think I really want to talk about that...

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.540
S-sorry...

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:20.040
Don't worry about me!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.210
Natsuo-kun, don't you have any worries?

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:24.040
Why don't you tell your big sister here!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.750
Huh? "Worries"? Do I have any...?

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:32.170
Maybe this? My naturally curly hair.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.580
You saw my bed head yesterday.

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:36.290
It's a pain every morning.

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:39.290
What?! That's your hang-up?!

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:42.080
You totally don't have to worry about that!

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:45.210
If anything, you look just as cute with your bed head.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:47.880
From my viewpoint, I'm actually jealous...

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:53.210
As for me, I've got super straight and fine hair,
so it's got no volume and...

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.420
See? Try feeling it.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:02.250
Whoa!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.580
Hey!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.170
Caught you off guard!

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:09.420
Well, you know, you had an expression
that was just asking to be messed with.

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:10.670
What's with you?!

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.960
It's like you totally have your guard down and-

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.880
Y-you gotta be careful...

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:20.080
Sorry...

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:31.460
Shuu Hagiwara

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:31.460
Incoming call...

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.790
Hello?

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.080
Yeah...

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.880
Shuu... Hagiwara...
Huh? Right now?

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.290
Fine. See ya.

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:41.830
I'm gonna head out for a bit.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.710
Huh? At this hour?

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.000
It's dangerous!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.290
Don't worry. I'll just be out in front of the house.

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:55.170
Natsuo-kun, you stay inside, okay?

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:09.670
It's already been about twenty minutes...

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:14.750
Maybe I should go out and check.
If something happened...

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:18.830
Enough!

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.500
Sensei...!

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:28.040
What's wrong?! Did something happen?! Sensei-

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.040
I'm fine.

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:34.000
It's nothing. I'm fine, really...

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:39.500
That can't be! You clearly look...

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.130
Besides, you're shaking this badly and...

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:00.710
It's fine.

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:03.710
You don't have to answer it.

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.080
But...

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:08.920
What's wrong?

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:13.750
